{"content":[{"c":["AMON (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Governor of the city of Samaria during the reign of Ahab in Israel (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.22.26","r":"1Kgs.22.26","rawR":"1Kgs.22.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.22.26","value":"1Kgs.22.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 22:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.18.25","r":"2Chr.18.25","rawR":"2Chr.18.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.18.25","value":"2Chr.18.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 18:25"},"). Amon imprisoned the prophet Micaiah while Ahab defied Micaiah’s warning against attacking Ramoth-gilead."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. King Manasseh’s son, the 15th king of Judah (642–640 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"). Amon was 22 years old when he became king. He indulged in idolatry like his father and after a two-year reign was assassinated in a palace coup (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.21.19-26","r":"2Kgs.21.19-26","rawR":"2Kgs.21.19-26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.21.19-26","value":"2Kgs.21.19-26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 21:19-26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.33.20-25","r":"2Chr.33.20-25","rawR":"2Chr.33.20-25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.33.20-25","value":"2Chr.33.20-25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 33:20-25"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=IsraelHistoryof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"IsraelHistoryof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"IsraelHistoryof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Israel, History of"},"; ",{"href":"?item=ChronologyoftheBibleOldTestament_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ChronologyoftheBibleOldTestament_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ChronologyoftheBibleOldTestament_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Chronology of the Bible (Old Testament)"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Official of Solomon; his descendants returned to Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.59","r":"Neh.7.59","rawR":"Neh.7.59","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.59","value":"Neh.7.59"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:59"},"). The spelling Ami (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.57","r":"Ezra.2.57","rawR":"Ezra.2.57","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.57","value":"Ezra.2.57"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:57"},") is a variant of this name."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Egyptian god, probably a fertility deity (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.46.25","r":"Jer.46.25","rawR":"Jer.46.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.46.25","value":"Jer.46.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 46:25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"AmonPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 22:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.22.26","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.22.26","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.22.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 18:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.18.25","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.18.25","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.18.25"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 21:19-26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.21.19-26","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.21.19-26","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.21.19-26"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 33:20-25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.33.20-25","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.33.20-25","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.33.20-25"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:59","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.59","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.59","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.59"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:57","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.57","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.57","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.57"},{"anchorText":"Jer 46:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.46.25","rawQueryValue":"Jer.46.25","sourceRefExact":"Jer.46.25"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7e35c14ef3a987a6edc94b897b4bd5f4ed51fd2ac70aa4ab5788f820560cd027","sourceItemName":"AmonPerson","sourceItemOrder":309,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"AmonPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Amon (Person)","title":"Amon (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}